  "notes": [
    "PERIOD CORRECTION: the catalog lists this document as 2019 Q1, but the form prints \"Period Covered: Q4, 2018\" (a receiving stamp is dated 3/14/19). period.year/quarter are set to the printed 2018 Q4; figures are cumulative for CY 2018.",
    "The page is scanned sideways (rotated 90 degrees); it was rotated for reading. All values are legible.",
    "Internal Revenue Allotment is printed as 0.00 in the General Fund, SEF and Total columns (target 843,169,841.00), and its \"% of total income\" is 0.00 %. External Sources (66,156,483.29) and Total Current Operating Income (1,532,006,259.25 GF) are consistent with IRA = 0, so the CY 2018 income on this form excludes the IRA. Transcribed as printed.",
    "The Tax Revenue General Fund figure 1,256,207,728.26 has a pen mark over its last digits and the SEF figure 222,507,338.02 has a mark over the '8'; both equal the sum of their items and the identical Real Property Tax SEF figure.",
    "The Income Target column prints current operating expenditure appropriations only for Debt Service (FE) (2,030,000.00); all other expenditure targets are 0.00. Net Operating Income target 2,431,461,041.00 = 2,433,491,041.00 - 2,030,000.00 as printed.",
    "The % column is blank on the supplemental/total-available lines, on Other Non-Income Receipts through Total Amount Available for Capital Expenditures, on Other Non-Operating Expenditures, and from Total Non-Operating Expenditures onward; recorded as null. Net Operating Income prints 0.00 %.",
    "Two labels are partly covered by white blots on the scan (\"Health, Nutrition & Population Control\" and \"OTHER NON-INCOME RECEIPTS\"); the visible fragments match the standard BLGF labels. The NTA line is printed as \"Internal Revenue Allotment\". This form has no GF/SEF reconciliation table and no Total Assets line.",
    "The first digit of the Other Taxes percentage (6.94 %) is faint in the scan and could be read as 5; 6.94 matches 121,989,522.03 / 1,757,296,522.17. Likewise the Health percentage 10.65 % is partly covered by a blot and matches 125,363,151.41 / 1,177,575,765.49."
